  <h2>Her St Ive home is a museum once more.</h2>
  <p>The restored Victorian Rectory where Emily grew up is now <em>The Story of Emily</em>, with an immersive War Rooms exhibition about her work during the South African War. The project was named RIBA South West & Wessex Building of the Year in 2025.</p>
